    {
      "id": "p0250-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "It's revealed that whoever has the most \"determination\" in the Underground is able to use the in-game save menu functions. In other words, the most determined person in the Underground can freely load and save their progress. This is what allows the player to save and load their progress, just like in any other game. Except here, it's the actual, physical player's determination that enables this ability. The main character is just along for the ride.",
        "raw": "It's revealed that whoever has the most \"determination\" in the Underground\nis able to use the in-game save menu functions. In other words, the most\ndetermined person in the Underground can freely load and save their progress.\nThis is what allows the player to save and load their progress, just like in any\nother game. Except here, it's the actual, physical player's determination that\nenables this ability. The main character is just along for the ride.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28889864,
          0.08880714,
          0.89316301,
          0.19356429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28651822,
          0.08809286,
          0.89607802,
          0.19463571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5,
          6,
          7
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "游戏揭晓，地下世界中“决心”最强的存在，能够使用存档菜单。换句话说，此人可以自由保存、读取进度。这也是玩家能像玩其他游戏一样存读档的原因；区别在于，这次赋予能力的是现实中玩家本人的决心，主角只是随之行动。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
