    {
      "id": "p0250-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "During this final battle, Asriel absorbs and corrupts the souls of Sans, Papyrus, Undyne, and every other important story character. With all this new power, Asriel immobilizes the main character and takes control over the save menu. This becomes clear when the player reaches out for the save file, only to fail.",
        "raw": "During this final battle, Asriel absorbs and corrupts the souls of Sans, Papyrus,\nUndyne, and every other important story character. With all this new power,\nAsriel immobilizes the main character and takes control over the save menu.\nThis becomes clear when the player reaches out for the save file, only to fail.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
